  "description": "*\"People become ugly when they're in love.\"* \n\nThose are the feelings both Yeon-Ji and her closest friend Mu-Re shared when it came to romance. Despite that, Yeonji risks their friendship by asking out Mu-Re before being brutally rejected. Cursing her former friend's name, she wakes up the next day with the ability to read a person's romantic feelings as though she were in a dating sim! \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
